<title>USA: DI Industries Inc Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>DI Industries Inc Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.09     loss	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net loss		  11,563     loss	 8,202</p>
<p> Revs			20,451		   22,106</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 123,136		   38,669</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.18     loss	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net loss		  11,722     loss	13,447</p>
<p> Revs			81,767		   94,709</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  67,495		   38,669</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 includes non-recurring charges of $5.5 million.</p>
<p>1995 Q4 includes charges of $5.3 million.</p>
<p>1996 year includes gain of $3.1 million from asset sales and a $6.1 million charge from restructuring.</p>
<p>1995 year includes a $5.3 million charge related to writedown of property and equipment.</p>
